# Append-only index files: two builder seats append rows concurrently, and taking
# either side would silently drop the other's row. Union keeps both.
# Permitted here because .github/workflows/verify-notebooks.yml fails CI on a
# duplicate id in either file — the backstop the merge-conflict-resolution
# precept requires before union may be applied to an id-bearing index.
CONSCIOUSNESS/tasks/TASK-DONE-INDEX.md merge=union
CONSCIOUSNESS/reviews/REVIEW-INDEX.md merge=union
CONSCIOUSNESS/CHANGELOG.md merge=union

# Notebooks are committed without outputs; treat as text for sane diffs.
*.ipynb text
